\f3\b\fs61\fsmilli30875 \cf2 \cb3 LINK: Grab the\'a0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://promptkit.natebjones.com/20260508_104_promptkit_1"}}{\fldrslt \ul prompts}}
\f4 \cb1 \
